
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>My Personal Profile</title>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 20px;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f3f4f6;
      color: #333;
    }

    .profile {
      max-width: 380px;
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: center;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px #00000012;
    }

    h1 {
      color: black;
    }

    p {
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    ul {
      display: inline-block;
      margin: 0 auto;
      text-align: left;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main class="profile">
    <h1>Hi, I'm Peace!</h1>

    <p>
      I am a student who enjoys learning new things
      and exploring technology.
    </p>

    <h2>My Hobbies</h2>

    <ul>
      <li>Listening to music</li>
      <li>Reading</li>
      <li>Cooking</li>
      <li>Traveling</li>
    </ul>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
